{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はパシフィコ横浜にて\n握手会がありました\n来てくださった皆様ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/05/3055475/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/05/3055475/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops:Rirandture\nskirt:Rirandture"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/05/3055475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"one-piece:Another Edition"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしながらメイドさんをやりました\n写真は時間がなくて撮れませんでした\nごめんなさい...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来た方限定 と言う事で(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部という朝早い時間から\nたくさんの方が来てくれて\nすごく嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様早起きで来てくださり\nありがとうございます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、15枚目の握手会と少し部数が増え\n関東は3部制、地方は2部制になりました\nまたまた早起きが大変になると思いますが\nお待ちしています〜(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/05/3055475/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラフト１位は夢のまた夢さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きなおかしで真っ先に思い浮かぶのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→カントリーマアム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レンジで10秒ほど温めて食べると\n本当に美味しいんですよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"島根の悠ちゃんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・男性のワイシャツで好きな色は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→白！水色も好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"としきさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きな男性の髪型はショート？ミディアム？ロング？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→似合っていれば長さは問題ないです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コジコジさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛が例えばラジオに投稿するとして\nラジオネームを付けるとしたら\nどんな名前にしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→爪の塊は嵐を呼ぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりぃさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛の好きな入浴剤は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→柑橘系がやはり落ち着きますね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜\nまだまだ受け付けますよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりあんさー◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去と未来ならどちらに行きたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計結果は過去が多かったです\n未来に行きたいという方は\n過去があるから今の自分がいるから\nなどという風に答えてくださいました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなおでんの具は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにてお待ちしています〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・6/9発売 UTB+ Vol.32"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・6/24発売 FIASHスペシャル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/06/05/3055475/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}